[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822917298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105671#issuecomment-2822917298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105671","id":2822917298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oQkyy","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T02:43:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T02:45:15Z","body":"I think `gradle_do_not_strip` is better here. It clearly indicates that it’s related to Gradle and aligns with the default behavior where Android strips symbols from `.so` files unless explicitly told not to. In contrast, `separate_debug_symbols` doesn’t make the Gradle context obvious and also flips the default behavior, now it avoids stripping by default.\n\nI want to preserve the default gradle behaviour.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822917298/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835286823","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105671#issuecomment-2835286823","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105671","id":2835286823,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o_wsn","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T13:41:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T13:41:01Z","body":"The more I think about this, the more I think this PR is the way to go:\r\n\r\n- It's a little weird/unexpected that `gradle_do_not_strip=yes` prevents the generation of the separate debug symbols (ie there's no `native-debug-symbols`), because \"not stripping\" doesn't imply (at least to me) not generating the separate symbols. But if the option was `separate_debug_symbols` then it's very clear that `yes` generates separate symbols and `no` doesn't\r\n- PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105808 was just posted implementing `separate_debug_symbols` for the web, and that's another platform setting expectations around this argument that Android would be different from","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835286823/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835697890","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105671#issuecomment-2835697890","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105671","id":2835697890,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pBVDi","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T15:47:36Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T15:47:36Z","body":"> * PR [[Web] Fix `separate_debug_symbols=yes` and debug experience #105808](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105808) was just posted implementing `separate_debug_symbols` for the web, and that's another platform setting expectations around this argument that Android would be different from\r\n\r\n@dsnopek This is a good argument to keep consistency across the platforms, so I'm good for this PR to go as is!\r\n\r\n> I want to preserve the default gradle behaviour.\r\n\r\n@syntaxerror247 The added logic should keep the default behavior:\r\n\r\n```\r\nif env[\"debug_symbols\"] and not env[\"separate_debug_symbols\"]:\r\n        gradle_process += [\"-PdoNotStrip=true\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe addition of the `doNotStrip=true` flag is also guarded by the `debug_symbols` parameter so:\r\n- on regular build (e.g: `scons platform=android generate_android_binaries=yes`, gradle will strip the generated binaries, maintaining the default behavior\r\n- on build with `debug_symbols` enabled (e.g: `scons platform=android generate_android_binaries=yes debug_symbols=yes`), the `doNotStrip=true` parameter will be added, causing the generated binaries to include the debug symbols. I think we can argue this should be the default behavior when enabling `debug_symbols` as it allows engine developers the ability to quickly investigate issues without having to reach for an external debug symbols file\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835697890/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2836259344","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105671#issuecomment-2836259344","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105671","id":2836259344,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pDeIQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T19:15:57Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T19:15:57Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2836259344/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]